<% if @created_at.present? %>
  Hey <%= @user.display_login %>,

  A new <%= @provider %> social identity was recently linked to your GitHub account on <%= @created_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %> from the email address <%= @email %>.

  This means you can now sign in to GitHub using the <%= @provider %> account associated with that email address.

  To see this and other security events for your account, visit <%= settings_user_audit_log_url %>

  If you did not initiate this action or believe your account has been compromised, it is a good idea to review
  your active sessions and all passkeys associated with your account or consider enabling two-factor authentication.

  Thanks,
  The GitHub Team
<% else %>
  Hey <%= @user.display_login %>,

  A new <%= @provider %> social identity was just linked to your GitHub account from the email address <%= @email %>.

  This means you can now sign in to GitHub using the <%= @provider %> account associated with that email address.

  To see this and other security events for your account, visit <%= settings_user_audit_log_url %>

  If you did not initiate this action or believe your account has been compromised, it is a good idea to review
  your active sessions and all passkeys associated with your account or consider enabling two-factor authentication.

  Thanks,
  The GitHub Team
<% end %>
